CRISTEL ESCOTO posted a new assignment in English (Anglo-American  
Literature) 9-Einstein <https://classroom.google.com/c/MTkwMzg2ODI2MTg1>.

Due: Apr 15
Persuasive Writing
Study an editorial cartoon from a local newspaper, and then decide
whether you will be in favor or against a particular issue being raised.  
Write a persuasive paragraph that includes facts to support your argument.

Note:
*The paragraph should have a range of 250-300 words
*Include the references used in editorial cartoon and factual information
